      "id": "a9b6260c0e6f-q7",
      "number": 7,
      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: Rising noise pollution in urban areas is affecting children's concentration. Conclusion I: Urban children can't study well. Conclusion II: Controlling noise pollution may improve children's concentration.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: Rising noise pollution in urban areas is affecting children&#39;s concentration.</p>\n\n<p>Conclusion I: Urban children can&#39;t study well.</p>\n\n<p>Conclusion II: Controlling noise pollution may improve children&#39;s concentration.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I follows",
          "html": "Only I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II follows",
          "html": "Only II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both follow",
          "html": "Both follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither follows",
          "html": "Neither follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Conclusion I: Urban children can't study well. - False (Because the statement says concentration is affected, but it does not say children cannot study at all.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Conclusion II: Controlling noise pollution may improve children's concentration. - <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">True</span> (Because noise pollution is affecting concentration, then reducing or controlling it may improve concentration. The word “may” makes it logically valid.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, only II follows.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
