      "id": "a9b6260c0e6f-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option. Statement: The introduction of Artificial Intelligence into healthcare systems can enhance diagnostic accuracy, but its widespread implementation may lead to ethical dilemmas in patient care. Assumptions: I. AI can improve healthcare diagnostics. II. The ethical concerns surrounding AI in healthcare are significant. III. AI will eventually replace human healthcare professionals.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: The introduction of Artificial Intelligence into healthcare systems can enhance diagnostic accuracy, but its widespread implementation may lead to ethical dilemmas in patient care.</p>\n\n<p>Assumptions:</p>\n\n<p>I. AI can improve healthcare diagnostics.</p>\n\n<p>II. The ethical concerns surrounding AI in healthcare are significant.</p>\n\n<p>III. AI will eventually replace human healthcare professionals.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I and II are implicit",
          "html": "Only I and II are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II and III are implicit",
          "html": "Only II and III are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "All I, II and III are implicit",
          "html": "All I, II and III are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only I is implicit",
          "html": "Only I is implicit"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. AI can improve healthcare diagnostics. <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-42fd5028-7fff-b6c3-ef01-32521f94342b\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">→ <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Implicit</span> </span></span>(The statement implies AI can enhance diagnostic accuracy. If AI cannot improve diagnostics, the statement would not be valid.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. The ethical concerns surrounding AI in healthcare are significant. <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-42fd5028-7fff-b6c3-ef01-32521f94342b\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">→ <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Implicit</span> </span></span>(The statement implies widespread implementation may lead to ethical dilemmas. For this to be meaningful, ethical concerns must exist and be relevant.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">III. AI will eventually replace human healthcare professionals. <span id=\"docs-internal-guid-42fd5028-7fff-b6c3-ef01-32521f94342b\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">→ Not Implicit (</span></span>The statement does not explicitly mention replacement — only enhancement and ethical concerns.<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;\">)</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, only I and II are implicit.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
