      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: All metro stations are under CCTV surveillance. Conclusions: I. Activities at metro stations are being monitored. II. No criminal activity can happen in metro stations.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.</p>\n\n<p>Statement: All metro stations are under CCTV surveillance.</p>\n\n<p>Conclusions:</p>\n\n<p>I. Activities at metro stations are being monitored.</p>\n\n<p>II. No criminal activity can happen in metro stations.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only Conclusion I follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only Conclusion II follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Activities at metro stations are being monitored. - <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">True</span> (If metro stations are under CCTV surveillance, activities there are being monitored/recorded.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. No criminal activity can happen in metro stations. - False (CCTV surveillance does not guarantee that crime cannot occur — it only helps monitor or record it.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, only Conclusion I follows.</p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
