      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: No artist are athletes. Some athlete are painters. All artists are painters. Conclusions: I. Some painters are athletes. II. Some athletes are not painters.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.</p>\n\n<p>Statement:&nbsp;<span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">No artist</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;are athletes. Some&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">athlete&nbsp;are&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">painters.</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">&nbsp;All artists are painters.</span></p>\n\n<p>Conclusions:</p>\n\n<p>I. Some painters are athletes.</p>\n\n<p>II. Some athletes are not painters.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I follows",
          "html": "Only I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only II follows",
          "html": "Only II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/26/03/IMG-2114%20Ratna%2018%20-3%20-26_D200.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 100px;\" /></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Conclusions:</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Some painters are athletes - <strong>Follow</strong> (As some athlete are painters. so, some painters are definitely athletes).</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Some athletes are not painters - <strong>Does not follow</strong> (As some athlete are painters. so, some painters are definitely athletes but we can not say that some athlete are not painter)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, only I follows.</p>\n",
